    <bpmn:process id="W_W3065" name="W3065. Kit &amp; Bundle Product Strategy, Definition &amp; Lifecycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Category strategy or gap/opportunity identified
Frequency: Seasonal + event-driven
Volume: Kit/Bundle item type (model company §6.4); seasonal programs
Owner: Merchandising Category Manager
Participants: Category Mgr, Merchandising Planning, Marketing, Supply Chain
Source: workflow W3065 — Kit &amp; Bundle Product Strategy, Definition &amp; Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3065_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3065_Lane1" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3065_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3065_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3065_Lane2" name="Merchandising Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3065_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3065_Lane3" name="Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3065_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3065_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3065_Start5" name="Category strategy or gap/opportunity identified">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3065_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3065_Task6" name="Category Manager identifies kit/bundle opportunities (contractor combo packs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Manager identifies kit/bundle opportunities (contractor combo packs, bathroom/kitchen complete sets, tool sets, seasonal starter kits) from basket analysis and customer input
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per season</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3065_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3065_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3065_Task7" name="Merchandising Planning defines kit type: pre-packaged kit (built at DC/vendor)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandising Planning defines kit type: pre-packaged kit (built at DC/vendor), virtual bundle (price-only, components sold together), or display bundle (assembled at store)
Responsible (R): Merchandising Planning
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per kit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3065_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3065_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3065_Task8" name="Merchandising/Marketing approve kit concept, target customer, channel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandising/Marketing approve kit concept, target customer, channel (in-store/ecommerce), and lifecycle (seasonal vs. evergreen); document strategy
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Marketing
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per kit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3065_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3065_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3065_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3065_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3065_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-505 (ensure controlled execution — Kit &amp; Bundle Definition, BOM &amp; Build Planning (PA-92.1).) | - operational: basket analysis and test builds
Owner: Merchandising Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3065_Assoc11" sourceRef="W3065_Annotation10" targetRef="W3065_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3065_Flow12" sourceRef="W3065_Start5" targetRef="W3065_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3065_Flow13" sourceRef="W3065_Task6" targetRef="W3065_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3065_Flow14" sourceRef="W3065_Task7" targetRef="W3065_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3065_Flow15" sourceRef="W3065_Task8" targetRef="W3065_End9" />
    </bpmn:process>
