        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-505 (ensure controlled execution — Kit &amp; Bundle Definition, BOM &amp; Build Planning (PA-92.1).) | - operational: cost roll-up and margin floor
Owner: Pricing Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3067_Assoc11" sourceRef="W3067_Annotation10" targetRef="W3067_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
