    <bpmn:process id="W_W3068" name="W3068. Kit/Bundle Master Data, SKU Setup &amp; Configuration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Kit approved for launch
Frequency: Per kit + change
Volume: Per active kit
Owner: Master Data Manager
Participants: Master Data, Merchandising, IT, Ecommerce
Source: workflow W3068 — Kit/Bundle Master Data, SKU Setup &amp; Configuration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3068_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3068_Lane1" name="Master Data">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3068_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3068_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3068_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3068_Lane2" name="Ecommerce">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3068_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3068_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3068_Start4" name="Kit approved for launch">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3068_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3068_Task5" name="Master Data creates kit SKU with attributes (item type Kit/Bundle, weight…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Master Data creates kit SKU with attributes (item type Kit/Bundle, weight, dimensions, hazmat, images, category, tax) per item-master standards (links to VS-29)
Responsible (R): Master Data
Accountable (A): Master Data Manager
Duration: Per kit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3068_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3068_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3068_Task6" name="Master Data/IT configure kit behavior: stocked kit (inventory at kit SKU)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Master Data/IT configure kit behavior: stocked kit (inventory at kit SKU), virtual bundle (price-only, deduct components at sale), or assembly order kit
